{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HAB","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"哈巴谷书","commonName":"哈巴谷书","title":"哈巴谷书","order":35,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"27e8baa39eb6443a7e10b27edb3723b342eb500d5102d70e20e335dcf084f717","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HAB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HAB/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":56},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶和华回答哈巴谷"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"我要站在守望所，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"立在望楼上观看，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看耶和华对我说什么话，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我可用什么话向他诉冤","poem":1},{"noteId":0},{"text":"。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"他对我说：将这默示明明地写在版上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使读的人容易读","poem":1},{"noteId":1},{"text":"。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为这默示有一定的日期，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"快要应验，并不虚谎。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"虽然迟延，还要等候；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为必然临到，不再迟延。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"迦勒底人自高自大，心不正直；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惟义人因信得生。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["不义的结局"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"迦勒底人因酒诡诈，狂傲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不住在家中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"扩充心欲，好像阴间。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他如死不能知足，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"聚集万国，堆积万民都归自己。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这些国的民岂不都要提起诗歌并俗语讥刺他说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祸哉！迦勒底人，你增添不属自己的财物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"多多取人的当头，要到几时为止呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"咬伤你的岂不忽然起来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"扰害你的岂不兴起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你就作他们的掳物吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因你抢夺许多的国，杀人流血，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向国内的城并城中一切居民施行强暴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以各国剩下的民都必抢夺你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"为本家积蓄不义之财、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在高处搭窝、指望免灾的有祸了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你图谋剪除多国的民，犯了罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你的家蒙羞，自害己命。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"墙里的石头必呼叫；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"房内的栋梁必应声。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以人血建城、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以罪孽立邑的有祸了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"众民所劳碌得来的被火焚烧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列国由劳乏而得的归于虚空，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不都是出于万军之耶和华吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"认识耶和华荣耀的知识要充满遍地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像水充满洋海一般。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"给人酒喝、又加上毒物、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他喝醉、好看见他下体的有祸了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你满受羞辱，不得荣耀；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你也喝吧，显出是未受割礼的！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华右手的杯必传到你那里；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的荣耀就变为大大地羞辱。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你向黎巴嫩行强暴与残害","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惊吓野兽的事必遮盖你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因你杀人流血，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向国内的城并城中一切居民施行强暴。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"雕刻的偶像，人将它刻出来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有什么益处呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"铸造的偶像就是虚谎的师傅。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"制造者倚靠这哑巴偶像有什么益处呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"对木偶说：醒起！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"对哑巴石像说：起来！那人有祸了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这个还能教训人吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看哪，是包裹金银的，其中毫无气息。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"惟耶和华在他的圣殿中；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"全地的人都当在他面前肃敬静默。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"-","text":"向他诉冤：或译回答所疑问的","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":1}},{"noteId":1,"caller":"-","text":"或译：随跑随读","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":2}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HAB/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HAB/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HAB/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":20}